  "details": "In order to use a synced variable, you need to manually add the VRC_Data Storage to the GameObject and then add your variable into the Data array.  If you do not add the Data storage, you will get a null exception when accessing the variable. If you have the data storage but do not have the variable added into it before uploading the world, the variable acts as a local variable.",
